  "limitations": [
    "One native account and region; no pagination behavior claimed. Lists use --no-paginate; unrelated resource rows are discarded before persistence.",
    "SNS filter changes can take up to 15 minutes; this experiment is capped at ten minutes. Unmatched non-delivery is bounded non-observation, not an exhaustive filter oracle.",
    "AWS CLI debug exists only transiently in memory for status extraction; no raw request signing material retained. SNS notification Signature fields are actual public message envelope fields.",
    "No custom metric data, SMS/email/mobile/HTTP/Lambda endpoints or FIFO resources. CloudWatch state is manually changed with TreatMissingData=ignore.",
